  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'BEDTIME ON THE FAST LANE

    Eight real truck-and-mattress platforms,
    three downhill races. Gravity supplies propulsion: there are no powered tires
    hidden under your mattress. Each valid finisher earns 8/7/6/5/4/3/2/1 points.
    DNF earns zero. Total ties compare best finishing positions, then tied leaders
    race again. Exact simultaneous finishes share a place.


    LEAN WITH MOVEMENT

    Left/right
    shifts weight and carves the fabric slide; forward/back shifts fore/aft balance
    and pitch. Momentum keeps moving while you spin. HOLD ACTION to brace: less rotation/bounce,
    more drag. The same controls, gravity, contact and recovery apply to every human
    and AI.


    FOLLOW THE FLAGS

    Pass the eight checkpoint gates in order,
    then cross the finish. Grass/mud/smoother sections, banks, rough patches and
    small crests change the physical ride. A sustained flip, fall or genuine stall
    returns you to the last passed safe checkpoint with a FIVE-SECOND stationary
    penalty; no forward skip. Three recoveries are available, then DNF. The generous100s
    race limit never invents a finisher. Ordinary slides and landings are not frozen.


    UP
    TO FOUR HUMANS

    Use independent keyboard clusters, controllers or exclusive
    shared sticks; AI fills eight. Names/colors and per-AI difficulty persist. Pause/disconnect
    preserves the race. Reconnect/replacement requires neutral and fresh input. Actual-pose
    highlights offer angle/speed/rewind/skip and advance automatically for AI. Offline
    only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
